      "SourceSection": "13.3: Get Ready to Experiment",
      "SourceExcerpt": "In an experiment where you are comparing two groups, one of which is being given a treatment and the other of which is the control group without any treatment, the treatment is the value of the variable that is changed for the treatment…",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u07-l13.rich-lesson-v2.json",
